# Component Patterns

## Layering
```tsx
// ✅ Route shell (app/)
const Signin = () => {
  const { step } = useMultistepForm([<Step1 />, <Step2 />], { animated: true });
  return <View className="flex-1">{step}</View>;
};

// ✅ Step screen (src/components/steps/)
const Step1 = ({ next }: MultiStepFormProps) => { /* form + API */ };
```

## Imports
- Primitives: `@src/components/libraries` (Text, TouchableOpacity, SafeAreaView)
- UI: `@globals/Button`, `@globals/FormikInput`, `@globals/Screen`
- Assets: `@assets/icons/...svg` (extension required)

## Styling
- Layout: NativeWind `className` (`flex-1`, `items-center`)
- Sizing/spacing: `hs()`, `vs()`, `ms()` — not raw pixel values
- Colors: `@src/constants/Colors`
- Fonts: Ranade-Regular (body), Excon-Medium (buttons/headings)
- Set `allowFontScaling={false}` on Text for design fidelity

## Forms
- Formik + Yup validation
- Use `FormikInput`, `FormikDropDown`, `FormikPhoneInput` wrappers
- API calls via RTK Query mutation hooks; handle with `.unwrap()` in try/catch

## Components
- Co-locate `types.ts` for prop interfaces (`IButtonProps`, etc.)
- Use `React.forwardRef` when wrapping inputs
- Multi-step flows: accept `next`, `back`, `goTo` from `MultiStepFormProps`
